menu "Nordic Bluetooth client"
    config NORDIC_BLE
        bool "Enable Nordic BLE adapter"
        depends on BT_NIMBLE_ENABLED
        default n
        help
            Requires NimBLE, Secure Connections only, two connections and NVS
            bond persistence. Use ble.defaults together with local board defaults.
    config NORDIC_BLE_NO_PIN_TEST
        bool "Use PIN-free BLE pairing for bench testing"
        depends on NORDIC_BLE && NORDIC_SOFTWARE_TEST
        default n
        help
            Use encrypted, bonded Secure Connections Just Works pairing without
            a PIN or USB enrollment window. Nearby devices can pair while this
            test image is installed. Disable after unloaded bench testing.
endmenu
